{"item":{"key":"moment:4820683","id":"4820683","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"b5a300c55ca321b3fca782fb"},"time":1768280830183,"text":"今天看见26年啦有肥肥还有误解，这里稍微跟大家讲一下吧。\n其实早在23年主包与A站的主播约就停啦，算是靠着ssr的支持继续直播走到现在哒。\n所以你们看到24年后基本没做什么翻唱投稿，因为视频约也停啦。\n其他主播我不太清楚，不过确实能感觉到站没有什么经费了。\n而我停约之后大头或者说全部的收入一直是靠直播和自制周边保底这样。\n所以28持续到现在才结束也很不赖了，我觉得也没有什么可抱怨的。\n所以跟着来讲因为规则变化，投喂的手段也要变化，不然无法支撑接下来的周边成本啦～","title":"","images":["29de3a362fb4cf6babb77846"],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":72,"likeCount":381,"bananaCount":318,"shareCount":1},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/4820683","commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":69,"archivedRoots":49,"commentPages":["comments/4820683/all/1.json","comments/4820683/all/2.json","comments/4820683/all/3.json"],"hotPages":[],"threads":{"805284166":{"pages":["comments/4820683/threads/805284166/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"805284166","root":"805284166","user":{"id":"33806853","name":"五毛desu","avatar":"75ed527239627177a0f4af49"},"text":"感谢水姐一直在[emot=acfun,1859/]","time":1768310461845,"floor":44,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"805278956":{"pages":["comments/4820683/threads/805278956/1.json"],"savedReplies":2,"reportedReplies":2,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"805278956","root":"805278956","user":{"id":"65749198","name":"明鹿丶（中奖版）","avatar":"45b9cb53fce7d1363ebb34b6"},"text":"股票多赚点[emot=acfun,1659/][emot=acfun,1659/]","time":1768291048849,"floor":31,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false}},"805278231":{"pages":["comments/4820683/threads/805278231/1.json"],"savedReplies":4,"reportedReplies":4,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"805278231","root":"805278231","user":{"id":"67226241","name":"via冰阔落","avatar":"69480f2a3eec33b6f62d0e10"},"text":"这个表情包好可爱呀[emot=acfun,1713